#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:32
msgid ""
"Configuration for data types such as exporting specific areas of the "
"server, exporting additional types of posts, file attachments, webhooks, "
"and bot messages is not yet supported. Deleted objects are also not yet "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"서버의 특정 영역 내보내기, 추가 글 유형, 파일 첨부, 웹훅, 봇 메시지 내보내기 같은 데이터 유형 "
"구성은 아직 지원되지 않습니다. 삭제된 객체도 아직 지원되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:34
msgid ""
"For requests to add additional attributes or objects to our exporter, "
"please add a feature request on our `feature idea forum "
"<https://portal.productboard.com/mattermost/33-what-matters-to-you>`_."
msgstr ""
"내보내기 도구에 추가 속성이나 객체를 추가해 달라는 요청은 `기능 아이디어 포럼 "
"<https://portal.productboard.com/mattermost/33-what-matters-to-you>`_\\ 에 기능 요청으로 추가하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:37
msgid "Bulk export data"
msgstr "데이터 대량 내보내기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:41
msgid ""
"Create a full export file including attachments by running the "
":ref:`mmctl export create -- attachments <administration-guide/manage"
"/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl export create>` command. See the "
":ref:`Mattermost data migration <administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-"
"export:create the export>` documentation for details."
msgstr ""
":ref:`mmctl export create -- attachments <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl export create>` "
"명령을 실행해 첨부 파일을 포함한 전체 내보내기 파일을 만듭니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`OKR.BEST "
"데이터 마이그레이션 <administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-export:create the export>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:43
msgid ""
"While the job is running, you can check its status by running the "
":ref:`mmctl export job show <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-"
"line-tool:mmctl export job show>` command."
msgstr ""
"작업이 실행되는 동안 :ref:`mmctl export job show <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl export job show>` "
"명령을 실행해 상태를 확인할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:45
msgid "When the export job status is successful:"
msgstr "내보내기 작업 상태가 성공이면:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:47
msgid ""
"Identify the name of the completed export file by running the :ref:`mmctl"
" export list <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl "
"export list>` command."
msgstr ""
":ref:`mmctl export list <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl export list>` "
"명령을 실행해 완료된 내보내기 파일의 이름을 확인합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:48
msgid ""
"Download the export file to your local machine by running the :ref:`mmctl"
" export download <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-"
"tool:mmctl export download>` command."
msgstr ""
":ref:`mmctl export download <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl export download>` "
"명령을 실행해 내보내기 파일을 로컬 컴퓨터로 다운로드합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:54
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v6.0, this command has been deprecated in favor of "
":ref:`mmctl export commands <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-"
"line-tool:mmctl export>` as the supported way to export data out of "
"Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost v6.0부터 이 명령은 OKR.BEST에서 데이터를 내보내는 지원 방식인 :ref:`mmctl export 명령 "
"<administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl export>`\\ 을 대신 사용하도록 사용 중단되었습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:56
msgid ""
"The export command runs in the :doc:`CLI </administration-guide/manage"
"/command-line-tools>`.  It has permissions to access all information in "
"the Mattermost database."
msgstr ""
"내보내기 명령은 :doc:`CLI </administration-guide/manage/command-line-tools>`\\ 에서 실행됩니다. "
"이 명령에는 OKR.BEST 데이터베이스의 모든 정보에 접근할 권한이 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:58
msgid "To run the export command:"
msgstr "내보내기 명령을 실행하려면:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:60
msgid ""
"Navigate to the directory where the Mattermost server is installed. On a "
"default install of Mattermost, the directory is ``/opt/mattermost``."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 서버가 설치된 디렉토리로 이동합니다. OKR.BEST 기본 설치에서는 디렉토리가 "
"``/opt/mattermost``입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:61
msgid ""
"Run the following command to extract data from all teams on the server. "
"Note that you can change the file name and specify an absolute or "
"relative path to dictate where the file is exported:"
msgstr ""
"서버의 모든 팀에서 데이터를 추출하려면 다음 명령을 실행합니다. 파일 이름을 변경하고 절대 또는 상대 "
"경로를 지정해 파일이 내보내질 위치를 정할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:63
msgid "``sudo -u mattermost bin/mattermost export bulk file.json --all-teams``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:65
msgid ""
"``sudo -u mattermost bin/mattermost export bulk /home/user/bulk_data.json"
" --all-teams``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:67
msgid "Retrieve your file from the location you specified."
msgstr "지정한 위치에서 파일을 가져옵니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/bulk-export-tool.rst:69
msgid ""
"All Mattermost bulk export data files will begin with a ``Version`` "
"object as the first line of the file. This indicates the version of the "
"Mattermost bulk import file format with which the exported data is "
"compatible."
msgstr ""
"모든 OKR.BEST 대량 내보내기 데이터 파일은 파일의 첫 줄에 ``Version`` 객체로 시작합니다. 이는 "
"내보낸 데이터가 호환되는 OKR.BEST 대량 가져오기 파일 형식의 버전을 나타냅니다."

